  f047: { lead: '116 years, not 100. The name is a later convention, and the discrepancy is exactly why it gets asked.' },
  f048: { lead: 'Agincourt in 1415: Henry V won against much larger French forces, largely thanks to the English longbow. It is the high point of the English position in France.' },
